WEBVTT

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:04.190
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:07.590
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:10.050
I guess they all found out about Ikuto, huh...

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.490
Amu-chan seems really down, doesn't she?

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:14.590
We've just gotta cheer her up then!

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:18.200
You can do it, Amu-chan! 
Go, win, Amu-chan!

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.330
That's right! We can't be sad forever!

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:24.680
Let's turn those frowns upside down!

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:25.590
Doki!

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:52.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:58.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:03.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:12.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:24.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:29.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:32.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:38.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:41.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:11.190
I hurt him.

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.610
Tsukiyomi Ikuto?

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:16.490
Why... are you here?

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:20.640
I was shacking up in her room.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.660
"Will you let me fall in love with you," was it?

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:28.410
Quite a passionate confession for a little boy.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.590
Ikuto, why are you telling him-

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:33.020
Amu-chan...

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:35.420
Amu-chan, you knew?

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.210
I see.

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:43.230
Wait!

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:50.440
What have I done?

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:53.010
I can never face Tadase-kun again...

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:55.640
Amu-chan...

00:02:56.570 --> 00:03:01.570
Episode 78
Amu-chan's Loong Day!?

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:13.100
What am I going to do?

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.440
Amu-chan!

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.450
Gloomy faces are forbidden!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:18.540
Come on now, cheer up! 
Let's go to school!

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:21.750
Do your best to put on a happy face!

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:25.220
I just can't... It's only been a day 
since <i>that</i> happened.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:29.730
I don't know how I should 
act around Tadase-kun.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:35.540
What's the matter, Tadase? 
You've been acting strange since yesterday.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.120
Did something happen?

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.350
Tadase!

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.660
Pull yourself together, Prince!

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:47.410
He didn't Character Change?

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:51.620
I'm fine. There's no need to worry.

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:53.630
Tadase?

00:03:58.010 --> 00:03:59.770
Let's go, Amu-chan.

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:00.720
Okay...

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:03.800
Good morning, Amu-chi!

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:04.840
Good morning.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.010
Good morning, Amu.

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:08.010
Good morning.

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:13.180
It doesn't look like Tadase-kun is here yet.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:14.480
Yeah, guess not...

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.910
Amu-chi, look, look!

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:18.480
What's this?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.440
It says you two are the "best couple!"

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.580
What's the matter?

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.530
Oh, it's nothing, never mind...

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:35.750
Amu-chi is acting weird today, 
don't you think?

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.250
Something must have happened 
yesterday afternoon.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.000
What do you mean? 
Like with Tadase?

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:44.220
Tadase-kun...

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:49.650
Until yesterday, seeing Tadase-kun 
only made me feel happy.

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:53.370
But now I'm afraid to face him.

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:54.730
Amu-chi!

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:56.850
Cheer up, girl!

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:00.230
We've gotta get you back 
to your usual cheerful self!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:01.860
Amu, how about a smile?

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:03.740
Ready, set...

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:10.490
{They are saying "piron!" in the script... it's sort of a katakana sound effect for acrobatics... I think best left unsubbed}

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.820
What? But I'm no different than usual...

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:15.110
Loyal subjects!

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:18.880
I have a serious royal proclamation!

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.100
Serious proclamation?

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:22.280
What is it-dechu?

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:24.590
Tadase is absent today due to a cold.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.410
That's it?

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:28.990
So that's all it was-dechu...

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:31.360
What do you mean "that's all"?!

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:34.490
Oh, I see. Tadase-kun's not coming today.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.770
Why do I suddenly feel so relieved?

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:43.550
Is his cold very bad?

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:45.650
It's nothing to fret over.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.270
I'm sure if he rests for a day, he'll be fine.

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:49.820
I see...

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:53.830
But without Tadase, what'll we 
do about today's meeting?

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:57.250
Ahem! For today, in Tadase's stead...

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.570
I, myself, will chair the meeting!

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:03.490
What? You got a problem with that?

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:06.050
Hey, why don't we all go 
check up on Tadase-kun?

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.070
Agreed!

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.960
But what about the meeting?!

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:12.530
Just give up-dechu.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:16.280
You're gonna come 
with us, right, Amu-chi?

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.000
Um...

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:18.900
Wait.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.980
Hotori-kun has a cold.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.810
It'd be too overwhelming 
for him if we all went.

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:30.800
So Amu-chan, could you go after school 
and be our representative?

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.120
Me?

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:33.630
Thanks.

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:36.110
S-Sure...

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:49.170
Thanks to this tuning fork, we've finally gained control of Ikuto.

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.060
Well done.

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:53.140
Thank you very much!

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:56.360
The first stage of the plan is complete.

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:59.000
Proceed to stage two!

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.020
Yes, Sir!

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:24.040
Hey, Lulu, don't you get the feelin' everyone's 
plum gone and forgot about us? {lol, plum gone, oh Nana}

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.380
Ya think?

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.900
I said, "ya think"?!

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:28.290
Just be quiet!

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:30.340
I don't care if everyone's ignoring me!

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:32.970
I'll just <i>make</i> them pay attention!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.100
That's the ticket, Lulu!

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.680
Get a move on, get to it, y'all!

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:41.220
I can sense a lost child over in that direction!

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:42.450
Let's go, Nana!

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:43.850
All right!

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:48.450
Visit the sick, visit the sick, let's all visit the sick! {Not that I can think of, they're just being dumb. Let them be~}

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:51.570
Visit the sick, visit the sick, let's all-

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:53.710
What's the matter?

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:55.270
I just can't do it.

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:56.790
Amu-chan...

00:07:56.790 --> 00:08:00.320
But don't you actually want to see him?

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:01.920
Yes, I do, but...

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.430
Hinamori Amu?

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:05.740
Lulu...

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.250
What's going on?

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.850
I guess this means the 
lost child is Hinamori Amu!

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:13.360
Her?

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:16.520
Now that you mention it, 
she has been acting kind of funny.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:21.200
Amu-chan has been plagued with troubles.

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:25.730
So even you have things 
to worry about, huh?

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.800
What's with her reaction?

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:32.820
I suppose that means 
something bad happened.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:40.700
Lulu, if you've got a question, 
just bust out and ask it, girl!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.100
Hinamori Amu!

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:46.190
You look so gloomy, you're puttin' 
me in a bad mood myself!

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:48.470
Whatever it was, 
try tellin' me about it.

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:49.630
Um...

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.960
Ah, good grief, quit your 
darn dilly dallyin'! {No. Never. "Jesus Christ" is completely inappropriate as an expletive for this show and in general.}

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:54.250
Y'all are Hinamori Amu, 
ain't ya!? {she goes further and further into the accent...}

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.700
You'd done better spill them beans! {this line is almost incomprehensible nagoyan accent... original: "Don to shitoryaa ehn da wa!" normal Japanese: "Don to shita hou ga ii n da"}

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:57.750
Lulu...

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:00.180
Thank you!

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:03.950
Ain't y'all embarrassed now!

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:06.140
Her face is completely red.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:07.480
Shut up!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.030
We're leaving, Nana!

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:09.900
Okay!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:20.250
What's with you, Lulu? Helpin' the target 
find their way isn't like ya. {I maintain that "y'all" means "you all" If you want it singular but slangy, please use "ya" wherever possible.}

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.660
Oh, be quiet! I mean it!

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:25.490
Can't believe I actually 
started to worry about her...

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.460
Damn you, Hinamori Amu!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.640
Isn't it bad to just 
not go see Tadase-kun?

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:41.140
I thought you felt a little 
better after seeing Lulu, but...

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:43.570
That's an entirely different problem.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:47.170
Um, excuse me.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.860
Have you seen a girl who looks like me?

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.580
No, I haven't.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:55.030
I see...

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.410
Excuse me...

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:03.160
Have you seen a girl who looks like me?

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:05.600
Huh? Didn't you just...

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:07.500
Ah, there you are!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.170
Nami!

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:11.670
Oh, Nemi!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.580
Sorry, sorry!

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:14.380
Twins?

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:16.550
Right!

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:22.510
So you're Nemi-chan, and you're Nami-chan?

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.770
No, no. I'm Nemi.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:27.270
And I'm Nami!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.970
They sure do look alike...

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:31.090
Like a mirror image!

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:33.420
Why have you two come here today?

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:37.040
Nami came to buy an upperclassman 
she likes a present.

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:39.140
Nemi's gonna help me pick it out.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:42.110
But then you ran off somewhere, Nami.

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:45.430
But we're twins. You should've 
known where I'd go.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:47.030
I guess, but...

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:50.350
So you can understand 
your twin like that?

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:52.330
Yeah, kinda!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.170
Right?

00:10:54.970 --> 00:11:00.540
If you're so in sync that even your movements 
match, that must mean you never fight!

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:02.050
Yeah, no kidding!

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:05.090
Tadase-kun...

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:08.410
Perhaps I said something 
I shouldn't have... {literally: "My mouth slipped"}

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:24.530
Today has been a really long day.

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:28.890
I understand how you feel, but you 
really should face Tadase-kun.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:30.910
Or will you avoid him 
the rest of your life?

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.080
Rest of my life?

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.830
Rest of my life...

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:37.910
Enough already, Amu-chan!

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:40.170
Cheer up and go see him, okay?

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.450
Here, just like this!

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:45.760
I was worried 'bout you, 
so I came to check up on you!

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:48.290
Man, Tadase-kun, you look awful!

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:51.330
'Course, it is all my fault!

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:53.150
No way, that's so wrong!

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:59.380
Shouldn't you just be yourself?

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:02.660
That's right! Just be 
the same old Amu-chan!

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:05.270
That's easier said than done...

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:08.240
I don't even known what that means right now...

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:13.160
Besides, if I do see him, 
what am I supposed to say?

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:15.900
I think you should tell him the truth.

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:17.460
The truth?

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:22.510
About Ikuto and how you didn't 
keep it a secret to hurt him.

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:24.620
Yeah, but...

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.520
I just can't!

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:32.530
Anything I said 
would sound like an excuse!

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:35.770
If you act now, it won't be too late.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:39.270
It's not true that you can't see him...

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:41.910
You've just convinced yourself that you can't.

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:44.870
But I know Tadase-kun will understand!

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:47.410
It's not like you to be 
so depressed, Amu-chan.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.620
You guys...

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.500
You're right.

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:55.610
I'm not being myself, am I?

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:57.220
Amu-chan is back!

00:12:57.220 --> 00:13:02.090
Yay, yay, Amu-chan! Go, go, let's go!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.590
I think you're a little too happy about this.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:06.430
I wonder if he really does have a cold...

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.260
Su!

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.730
I think I said something 
I shouldn't have again!

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:16.390
You make it sound like Tadase-kun lied about 
having a cold to avoid seeing Amu-chan!

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:21.640
So you guys were thinking that, too?

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:24.360
Well, you know...

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.400
I just can't go see him!

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:28.170
Amu-chan, calm down!

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:29.970
Let's be level-headed here!

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:31.490
I don't wanna hear that from you!

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:34.850
Hinamori Amu!

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:36.870
Lulu, calm down there!

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:40.130
What's the matter, hon?

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:42.980
Those two...

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:46.590
They sure look alike. Twins, huh?

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:49.570
Hey...

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:53.830
You like Senpai, too. Don't you, Nemi?

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:57.100
We're twins, so I know.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:00.060
You don't have to keep it from me.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:01.390
But...

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:05.320
You two are lost, aren't you?

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:10.690
Since you're twins, you probably 
have a bunch of worries.

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:14.240
Knowing everything about 
one another and all...

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:17.090
All those lost feelings you've held back...

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:21.410
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:32.360
Amu-chan, please cheer up.

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:34.310
A ? Egg!

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:36.540
Let's go, Amu-chan!

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:37.830
But...

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:39.630
Amu-chan!

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:41.880
I like Senpai, too!

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.940
It's not fair of you to say that now!

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:46.430
You're one to talk!

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:50.280
You knew I liked him from 
the start! You're being unfair!

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:53.740
This here's turnin' out pretty good, 
don't ya think, Lulu?

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:58.090
Man, what is she doing? 
Usually, at this point...

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.330
Lulu, what's the matter with ya?

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:01.940
Um...

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.290
There she is!

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.510
Nemi-chan and Nami-chan?

00:15:10.850 --> 00:15:12.010
Amu-chan!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:12.970
Guys!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:17.940
I can't believe you!

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.010
Oh no!

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:25.480
A twin Character Transformation?

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:30.500
Character Transformation: Twin Dream!

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.780
Don't copy me!

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:37.290
Whatever!

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:39.000
Don't copy <i>me!</i>

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.050
How?

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.880
I know exactly what you'll do!

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:59.240
I figured this would happen. 
Twins have double the power!

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:02.440
The Embryo's sure to show up, I bet!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:05.660
Now what will you do, Hinamori Amu?

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:09.890
I wonder what happened between those two...

00:16:09.890 --> 00:16:13.240
Did they have a fight?

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:15.820
They look pretty tough, anyway.

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:18.990
Regardless, we can't let them 
carry on like this.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.100
Amu-chan!

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:21.160
Right.

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.090
My heart:

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:26.720
My heart:

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:27.800
My heart:

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.250
Unlock!

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.050
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.820
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:16:58.270 --> 00:17:00.660
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:09.150
We've got two opponents. 
Let's split them up and cleanse them!

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:10.550
I'll take the girl on the right.

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:13.090
But which one would she be?

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:16.260
She's on the left now...

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.480
But didn't you say right?

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:19.070
Now she's on the left!

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:20.720
No, on the right!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.150
All right, fine!

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:25.520
We'll take you both on at once!

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:29.400
Go Go Little Duckies! {No in-line punctuation, per previous episodes and glossary and since it's an attack name~}

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:32.440
Tightrope Dancer!

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:47.600
Now, Amu-chan!

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:48.840
Roger!

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:51.950
Don't try to stop us!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.390
Amu-chan!

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:10.810
If only Tadase-kun were here now...

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:16.900
Tadase-kun...

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:17.990
Now!

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.290
Amu-chan!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.500
Amu-chi!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.500
Amu!

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:28.590
All right! That's the way!

00:18:28.590 --> 00:18:31.780
Sheesh, you've totally 
forgotten our original goal.

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:33.010
What'd you say?

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:34.550
Never mind!

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:38.590
Amu-chan, are you okay?

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.610
Yeah.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:41.110
Amu-chan!

00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:45.950
I don't know what happened 
between you and Hotori-kun...

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:49.100
But whatever it was, you're not alone.

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:51.020
Nagihiko...

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:52.820
That's right!

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:54.930
Be your happy self again!

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:57.860
'Cause you're our ultra-cool heroine, Amu-chi!

00:18:58.090 --> 00:19:01.490
It's not like you to space 
out during a battle, Amu.

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:04.330
Yaya... Rima...

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.390
What's going on?

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:08.350
Um, well...

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:10.110
Guys...

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:13.810
You're right.

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:16.180
I've gotta be myself!

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:20.960
Enough already!

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:24.900
You two usually get along so well!

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:26.720
So please, let's stop this fighting.

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.960
This is our problem, not yours!

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:31.020
You people wouldn't understand!

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:32.880
I do understand.

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:36.720
You two get along so well because 
you believe in each other.

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:41.600
And because of that, you can always be 
honest about your feelings. {Not quite literal, but I think it clarifies the meaning a bit. Japanese is too terribly vague so much of the time.}

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:44.540
You can talk about anything, so...

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:48.250
You've gotta keep 
believing in each other!

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:50.250
Amu-chan!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.280
Believing in each other?

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:59.630
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:05.590
Open Heart!

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:30.050
I'm sorry...

00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:32.390
No, I should be apologizing.

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:34.010
But I'm the one who...

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:35.380
I...

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:37.750
I like Senpai!

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:46.300
We're so close that...

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:48.580
...we even like the same guy.

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:52.210
Let's tell each other 
everything from now on, okay?

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:55.680
The same goes for you, Amu-chan!

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:01.820
Yeah!

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:12.890
Looks like no one's home.

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:15.830
Amu-chan...

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:21.180
Don't worry! Today didn't work out, 
but there's always tomorrow!

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:23.140
That's right!

00:21:23.140 --> 00:21:25.660
That's our girl!

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:29.180
Yay, yay, Amu-chan!

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:33.560
Yay, yay, Amu-chan! Yay, yay, Amu-chan!

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:33.560
Seriously, I think you're a little too happy about this.

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:35.560
I see.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:38.310
Is that what transpired?

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:39.110
Yeah.

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.020
Do not drag your feet, Tadase.

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:45.200
What kind of King are you, 
hesitating like this?

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:47.360
Honestly, a cold?

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:49.160
It was true.

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:52.300
So what will you do now?

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:56.360
I'll see her tomorrow and talk things over.

00:21:56.360 --> 00:21:59.740
Ah, good. Excellent, Tadase!

00:21:59.740 --> 00:22:01.300
Now that's more like the King!

00:22:12.180 --> 00:22:15.240
What's important is believing in each other.

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:36.260
Maybe I was wrong to pretend not to notice your worries.

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:41.070
It's okay if you can't tell me everything.

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.450
With that dark look on your face,

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:45.690
go ahead and scream dark things.

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:50.000
You shouldn't leave all those heavy feelings inside.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.480
Ride On!

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:57.680
If you don't... If it's like that...

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:00.600
You couldn't tell me if you wanted to, huh?

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:04.350
I get it.

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:07.010
I'm sure your circumstances will change one day.

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:10.040
That time will come! That time is now!

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:15.670
Don't you want to have someone

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:18.300
say congratulations to you once in your life?

00:23:18.300 --> 00:23:23.230
Doesn't the breeze feel nice today?

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:27.600
Even if you feel like it's all you can do to survive...

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:32.470
You can make your life into something you enjoy. It's so nice!

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:37.290
"Everything's for you."

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:41.890
How about that?

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:45.040
My boy!

00:23:50.260 --> 00:23:53.270
Hey, hey, did you know about Kukai?

00:23:53.270 --> 00:23:55.630
He's the youngest of five brothers!

00:23:55.630 --> 00:23:56.570
Really?

00:23:56.570 --> 00:23:58.250
And what's more, all of his older brothers...

00:23:58.590 --> 00:24:00.660
...are all totally hot!

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:02.160
Huh?! R-Really?

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:05.580
Girls! This is no time to be 
daydreaming about cute boys!

00:24:05.580 --> 00:24:09.970
Amu-chan is finally going to see the 
mysterious Character Transformation, Death Rebel!

00:24:09.970 --> 00:24:12.230
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.230 --> 00:24:14.880
Ikuto and Amu
Sorrowful Battle!

00:24:14.880 --> 00:24:19.460
Ikuto and me? But I can't fight him...
